      "title": "Note tags are limited to 10 per note on create and update",
      "summary": "validateCreateInput and validateUpdateInput reject more than 10 tags with {field:'tags', message:'A note can have at most 10 tags'}. The check runs only after the array-of-strings check passes, so each request gets at most one tags error.",
